# TASK-260715-1ozsb6 developer handoff — review-round-8 rework

Status: ready for review.

## Outcome

- Closed the round-8 teardown-admission defect by separating teardown-owned timeout races from the 64-slot ordinary async-operation registry.
- The single teardown owner has a fixed two-slot registry: one socket-close race and one automatic-task-join race. Reserved admission cannot fail because ordinary work is saturated, and unfinished teardown work remains visible in `LibSSH2OwnedResourceSnapshot`.
